[{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿 其一","author":"李春澄","text":"风流蕴藉有谁过，数载岩疆费抚摩。\n化比寇恂河内瘠，诗如元结道州多。\n中牟物望称三异，南国羔裘爱五紽。\n我亦伴他骑竹队，跻堂来唱裤襦歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44985,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿 其二","author":"李春澄","text":"琴鸣堂上玉鸣珂，案牍何曾废啸歌。\n风雅共知吾辈少，贤劳偏较友邦多。\n先敦孝友非沽誉，但豁胸襟即饮和。\n杯酒跻堂称介福，颂声摇曳比卷阿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44986,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿 其三","author":"李春澄","text":"治行争推第一流，东瀛南北借宣猷。\n人如生佛万家祝，座有清风满室浮。\n为凛官方高节著，欲舒民困苦心求。\n称觞齐庆华对祝，拟拜并州郭细侯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44987,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿 其四","author":"李春澄","text":"崧岳何时诞甫申，三秋爽气转洪钧。\n丁年已折高枝桂，甲子初周不老身。\n洛水人文誇领袖，瀛东子弟受陶甄。\n惟公张弛无声色，一个休休社稷臣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44988,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿五言古一首","author":"李薪传","text":"太行高维岳，降神钟灵异。\n双旌来淡海，竹马引儿戏。\n孝经课童子，书院培士气。\n愿言单父宰，心劳长抚字。\n岂识秋风起，莼鲈思欲嗜。\n孤松秀冬岭，遥遥祝青翠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44989,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿五言古一首","author":"辛仰高","text":"图治如我公，斯文欣振作。\n居官凛四知，造士怀三乐。\n循循善诱人，谆谆勖舞勺。\n玉石赋他山，自堪来攻错。\n德行先文章，昌明大而博。\n疾苦询劝风，良医能救药。\n敦俗劝农桑，深于求民莫。\n正宜不计功，渊源一濂洛。\n富贵等浮云，素志明淡泊。\n治事关治心，经纶裕经略。\n身是后彫松，封疆重寄钥。\n愿祝寿南山，曲奏南飞鹤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44990,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿长短歌一首","author":"辛凤翥","text":"羡曹公端正好棫朴，作人称寿考。\n何福不除，宜咏天保。\n杖乡日，蓬莱岛。\n宽兮仁兮，恰似无心大造。\n人知道是商山皓欤，我谓香山老。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44991,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿五言排律一首","author":"周承敬","text":"今日共称觥，当年赋鹿鸣。\n雄才挥笔阵，弱冠拔茅征。\n北阙蒲轮逮，南陬竹马迎。\n官方鳌岫著，宦迹凤山呈。\n会展交衢骥，旋迁出谷莺。\n紫陵飞舄至，淡水旧弦更。\n时雨随车澍，春风满座生。\n虚堂悬镜朗，片玉贮壶清。\n鹿洞规频训，鸿都字细评。\n卧碑齐士肄，停讼课农耕。\n政类屯田佛，人原洛社英。\n岁星符出丙，巴曲谱长庚。\n宽惠能滋福，廉勤不爱名。\n南山开寿域，东阁订诗盟。\n晋爵黄钟叩，摛词寸莛轻。\n有邦烝至治，大化普无声。\n郦菊他年饮，园葵此度倾。\n登龙怀御李，司马幸瞻荆。\n妙手栽花遍，天庥戬谷赓。\n弧辉宜久照，松柏重莼羹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44992,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿又 其一","author":"林玉文","text":"长庚灿烂彩云边，甲子盈筹颂大年。\n重九萸囊曾系佩，秋三菊酒正开筵。\n仁恩远播群黎洽，德政覃敷五福全。\n彭泽高风犹未邈，遐龄永享继名贤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44993,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿又 其二","author":"林玉文","text":"崧岳降神宰此间，仁心仁闻播乡关。\n椿萱长茂祥麟毓，兰桂腾芳瑞凤还。\n酒饮黄花倾北海，庭盈赤舄颂南山。\n有功文教铭钟鼎，万古英贤共仰攀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44994,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿五言排律","author":"林玉文","text":"邺下清风在，贤良夙慎修。\n抚绥安此邑，布化展鸿猷。\n庠序兴文甲，农桑重里州。\n三多徵华祝，五福叶箕畴。\n天上长庚焕，人间瑞气浮。\n召公堪比德，陶令恰为俦。\n对菊酣琼宴，跻堂举玉瓯。\n淡江恩泽溥，卧辙共攀留。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44995,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其一","author":"林兆龙","text":"寿域天开气运延，金茎十二露华鲜。\n我公想是琼浆饮，绿鬓朱颜不老仙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44996,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其二","author":"林兆龙","text":"寿星原本老人星，大德从来享大龄。\n旧社耆英堪再会，画图一幅绘丹青。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44997,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其三","author":"林兆龙","text":"寿算五旬有九秋，频闻海屋更添筹。\n今朝且把三多庆，明岁还赓六甲周。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44998,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其四","author":"林兆龙","text":"寿诞恭逢九月时，萸觞菊盏正相宜。\n当筵忽忆秋闱事，预指鹿鸣重宴期。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44999,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其五","author":"林兆龙","text":"寿酒欣斟绿满樽，西来爽气溢朱门。\n吾侪好似瑶池会，雪藕冰桃乐湛恩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45000,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其六","author":"林兆龙","text":"寿香一柱表心香，刻意申祈鹤算长。\n憩苃清风随处在，台南台北咏甘棠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45001,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其七","author":"林兆龙","text":"寿考作人久树勋，口碑载路足传闻。\n异时采入东都志，青史流芳颂使君。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45002,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其八","author":"林兆龙","text":"寿诗竞进祝冈陵，五老三神果可徵。\n巴语幸邀青眼顾，龙门百尺若荣登。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45003,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿五言古","author":"林廷鲲","text":"维公其伟矣，经纶满腹藏。\n宰世清于水，居官涖以庄。\n保民如保赤，仁意溢洋洋。\n立教先文德，栽培兰桂香。\n父母乾坤大，春秋日月长。\n应知仁者寿，何俟假彼苍。\n惟兹文甲士，此心终不忘。\n爰当崧降节，盥沐拜公堂。\n寿诗各献颂，寿酒各称觞。\n俾尔弥尔性，纯嘏咏尔常。\n八百椿并茂，三千桃比芳。\n吾侪托宇下，长以沐恩光。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45004,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿歌一首","author":"林邦彦","text":"大哉我公泰山北斗堪相比，大哉我公泽雨恩波不胜指。\n惟兹寿考能作人，歌功颂德更无已。\n溯自前年丁酉春，文甲乡庠初议起。\n余家不惜费千金，购地一区为基址。\n不意创难成更难，当事之人忽中止。\n星霜七阅未鸠工，适遇我公临玉趾。\n自捐鹤俸数百员，鼎力招募重修理。\n画栋雕梁壮大观，阖属生童赓孔迩。\n又蒙开课欲甄陶，举手加额欣然喜。\n济济彬彬聚一堂，三千何啻集朱履。\n玉尺量才新榜开，一经品题作佳士。\n佳者益奋拙者勤，争作龙门烧尾鲤。\n鼓励文风日振兴，吾侪刻意铸金祀。\n幸逢岳降在今辰，敢将华祝重申拟。\n愿我公多福多寿多男子，愿我公万古千秋长如此。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45005,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿五言排律 其一","author":"林炳旂","text":"循吏来虽暮，仁风化若驰。\n椿龄知不老，菊酒庆临耆。\n福命春秋当，神仙岁月迟。\n明伦经首孝，宣化德维慈。\n喜进长春颂，惭非绝妙词。\n作人宜寿岂，共乐太平时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45006,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿五言排律 其二","author":"林炳旂","text":"旧会耆英地，今来老健翁。\n变齐还变鲁，成德又成功。\n名占蓬莱顶，籍居天地中。\n福星临我辈，时雨遍蒙童。\n敬祝筹添海，欢呼寿比嵩。\n称觥非贡媚，仁化冠群公。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45007,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿五言排律 其三","author":"林炳旂","text":"北海开樽日，南山献颂年。\n群钦仁者寿，咸仰大夫贤。\n本是无双士，应推第一仙。\n福澄畴锡九，生并佛盈千。\n沛泽棠兼黍，钟灵涧与瀍。\n待看周甲子，称兕好随肩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45008,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿五言排律 其四","author":"林炳旂","text":"湛露承恩日，清秋介寿时。\n名标循吏传，望叶淑人诗。\n周甲欣何似，生申允若兹。\n淡江盘老鹤，洛水献灵龟。\n名教多真乐，劬劳念至慈。\n孝经基福祉，特此勖童儿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45009,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿","author":"林挺华","text":"寿星临我淡，政治普甘棠。\n学究天人蕴，名争日月光。\n孝经传小子，廉俸建胶庠。\n两袖清风在，深仁福泽长。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45010,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿 其一","author":"林扬声","text":"一团和气配乾坤，德化施行俗可敦。\n羲瑟农琴期近古，村箫社鼓乐沾恩。\n鹤飞谁唱东坡曲，燕会共开北海樽。\n为祝期颐长不老，升平人瑞庆公门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45011,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿 其二","author":"林扬声","text":"香焚宝鸭烛金莺，道是使君此日生。\n品拟黄花秋色淡，节徵古柏岁寒荣。\n登龙士共三多祝，附骥余同再拜赓。\n应识他年归去后，还将洛邑会耆英。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45012,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿","author":"林铭勋","text":"五年循政播弦声，淡水斯文仗主盟。\n夏雨化人原大德，春风坐我有馀情。\n菊泉敬藉金樽献，蓬饵唯将雪盌盛。\n偻指潞公庚甲会，如先一岁是同生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45013,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿柏梁古体","author":"林际华","text":"仰思夫子最公明，空如宝鉴平如衡。\n鼠牙雀角化无争，五年涖淡讼庭清。\n不闻诅声闻祝声，歌功颂德各输情。\n愿期寿考享长生，余虽童子心亦倾。\n幸同师友把诗赓，纸尾也将署一名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45014,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿","author":"高国泰","text":"南极星辉酒一觥，华封进祝拜双旌。\n堂阴树荫春长茂，菊水觞飞味亦清。\n德邵自宜多福禄，品高原媲会耆英。\n他年丹诏闻风起，瓯卜还应属老成。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45015,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿 其一","author":"张日新","text":"河南洛邑是名乡，间气收钟出庙廊。\n养正考亭蒙训阐，移风宣圣孝经扬。\n年几六帙乾行健，祝愿三多福泽长。\n最喜生辰重九后，黄花早灿介眉觞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45016,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿 其二","author":"张日新","text":"南极星明映素丝，跻堂称兕仰丰仪。\n青山不老千年鹤，绿水长生万岁龟。\n四皓高踪曾欲羡，一州重任竟难辞。\n讴歌尽庆华封祝，那止吾侪乐奏词。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45017,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿 其一","author":"张日宾","text":"古来寿耇本依仁，夫子仁声早入人。\n万井农桑家自理，五年童稚迹相亲。\n功成鹤俸捐文甲，课定鸡谈凛命申。\n共荷德辉遥献爵，灵椿岁岁锦堂春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45018,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿 其二","author":"张日宾","text":"黄花秋晚益芬芳，意味交蒸溢寿觞。\n蘧子行年几化境，荀公坐榻想清香。\n天因佑德重申福，人咏俾耆拜乙方。\n逐遂披云曾见日，区区华祝续霓裳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45019,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其一","author":"张国才","text":"学本由人性自天，功名富贵早超然。\n洛阳纵有耆英会，未及我公不老仙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45020,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其二","author":"张国才","text":"当秋九月庆华筵，老圃黄花晚节妍。\n雨露如今逢圣世，栽培长此乐尧天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45021,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其三","author":"张国才","text":"蕊榜喧传姓氏先，文章台阁吐青莲。\n天教盛德来敷治，故遣当年一等铨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45022,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其四","author":"张国才","text":"记得下车政绩宣，甘棠载咏入诗篇。\n澄清揽辔知公志，愿更弼时重仔肩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45023,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿仿古乐府 其一","author":"张达邦","text":"廉明勤恕，士女感恩施。\n廉明勤恕，士女感恩施。\n年高德劭，三畏四知。\n惟怀公义，不顾己私。\n弹琴俗化，解网心慈。\n歌以颂之，士女感恩施。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45024,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿仿古乐府 其二","author":"张达邦","text":"福禄祯祥，为公介眉寿。\n福禄祯祥，为公介眉寿。\n松柏之姿，异于蒲柳。\n诗赓数首，酒酌数斗。\n凡我同人，飏言拜手。\n祝之，为公介眉寿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45025,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿","author":"陈玉珂","text":"天生间世一耆儒，夙擅声名冠斗枢。\n芃黍欣膏霖雨降，甘棠喜见惠风敷。\n歌传淡北蚕成织，化被瀛东鳄听驱。\n此日霓裳同庆祝，敢将巴韵厕吹竽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45026,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿","author":"陈克昌","text":"元灯垂照绿莎厅，五载清风袭德馨。\n待士心无分畛域，染人术有甚丹青。\n后彫寒耐松长茂，晚节香浓菊制龄。\n记取来年周甲子，悬弧海外又辉星。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45027,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其一","author":"陈为","text":"青年文艺冠群英，桂籍标题第一名。\n简命特膺登仕版，清勤与慎竭丹诚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45028,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其二","author":"陈为","text":"移风易俗重明伦，德泽如膏信似春。\n转瞬行年知与化，甘棠垂荫咏深仁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45029,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其三","author":"陈为","text":"耆英胜会庆休祥，共祝三多介寿觞。\n帝德天休同眷顾，年年歌咏九如章。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45030,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其四","author":"陈为","text":"轩然霞举欲投簪，爱子爱民一片心。\n九老丰标堪济美，优游杖履抚昭琴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45031,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿","author":"陈国琛","text":"才冠河东孰与京，平章百姓玉壶清。\n村庄不见催科迫，衢巷惟闻纳税轻。\n德政钦明光紫极，仁风远播达长庚。\n陶钧万物功无量，寿比南山拟祖彭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45032,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿","author":"陈登岸","text":"大德如公夙慎修，遥知岁寿享千秋。\n时周甲子心仍壮，宰在方隅政自优。\n星映华堂比晋祝，天开海屋又添筹。\n要思群进长生曲，五载甘棠惠爱流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45033,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其一","author":"陈词裕","text":"雨露咸沾德泽深，栽培桃李有甘霖。\n弧星彩耀重阳后，拜祝添筹福海临。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45034,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其二","author":"陈词裕","text":"仰慕弦歌德可钦，殷殷乐育振儒林。\n甘棠载咏兴南国，记取冰壶一片心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45035,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其三","author":"陈词裕","text":"寤寐维思一曲琴，薰风拟再入新吟。\n衣冠旧族推嵩洛，五载淡江水最深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45036,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其四","author":"陈词裕","text":"翩彼飞鸮集泮林，八千椿算翠森森。\n华封晋祝麦邱颂，是采芝图嗣旧音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45037,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿","author":"陈对廷","text":"到处沾春雨，斯文戴福星。\n鹤随天与健，兕祝德维馨。\n绿野迟归计，桐乡仰典型。\n大椿秋未老，寿岂庆耆龄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45038,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿","author":"陈济川","text":"重修文甲喜初成，到处逢人说姓名。\n盈室芝兰皆后辈，满城桃李属先生。\n泰山北斗千年仰，化雨春风四座倾。\n幸遇今朝崧降日，跻堂寿酒各称觥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45039,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿","author":"游际清","text":"五载鸣琴治，千秋食德长。\n使君仁者寿，俾尔炽而昌。\n官价如归赵，民情甚发棠。\n南飞歌一曲，乡校亦公堂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45040,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿","author":"游观澜","text":"寿星高映五云端，梁孟眉齐岁月宽。\n四皓商山芝待采，九秋郦县菊频餐。\n廉能佐国成三异，诗礼趋庭见二难。\n淡水人家多种竹，为公日日报平安。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45041,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿颂四章","author":"黄文彬","text":"维岳降神，诞我公祖。\n幼学壮行，抚绥斯土。\n未及下舆，先询疾苦。\n衙蠹肃清，闾阎安堵。\n维岳降神，诞我公祖。\n奉扇仁风，随车甘雨。\n敦俗劝农，通商惠贾。\n子庶痌瘝，人称召父。\n维岳降神，诞我公祖。\n养育书田，栽培艺圃。\n力挽狂澜，中流砥柱。\n道一风同，海滨邹鲁。\n维岳降神，诞我公祖。\n南极星辉，受天之祜。\n菊节华筵，士民歌舞。\n祝寿而康，名昭千古。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45042,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其一","author":"黄宗岳","text":"春秋椿算八千年，银烛金樽肆绮筵。\n自古天心钟睌节，洛阳杖履亦神仙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45043,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其二","author":"黄宗岳","text":"水清不受半尘侵，大雅扶轮振士林。\n卅载甘棠誇苃憩，淡江桃李又成阴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45044,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿五言截句， 其一","author":"黄枚","text":"昔日云梯步，青年月殿扬。\n桂枝攀第一，姓字早生香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45045,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿五言截句 其二","author":"黄枚","text":"会作凤山宰，悠悠水利垂。\n天公将福报，再赐玉麟儿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45046,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿五言截句 其三","author":"黄枚","text":"德泽波斯淡，讴歌载路闻。\n偕民登寿域，不老是神君。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":45047,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]